ds_list_add(textList, "Misty, the Gym Leader of the Cerulean Gym in Kanto Region's Cerulean City,", "Is known across the land as perhaps the most accomplished Mallet-user!!", "Anyone or anything that stoked her ire might face the wrath of her mallet.", "Whether it was her friend Ash's Caterpie (seen here),", "Or, more commonly, she brought her Mallet's might to bear on her friend and traveling companion, Brock.","Her malleteering was so legendary,", "the term ''Misty's Mallet'' became synonymous with the practice of pulling a mallet out of nowhere when enraged.")